# LaTeX build litter. The published PDF lives at the repo root as /cv.pdf and
# IS committed (the site serves it) — it is the Action's output. A local
# preview build lands at cv/cv.pdf instead, and that one is ignored so it can
# never be mistaken for the published copy.
cv/cv.pdf
cv/*.aux
cv/*.bbl
cv/*.bcf
cv/*.blg
cv/*.fdb_latexmk
cv/*.fls
cv/*.log
cv/*.out
cv/*.run.xml
cv/*.synctex.gz
cv/*.toc

# OneDrive / Windows / macOS cruft
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
